    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41672" root="وجب" body-key="w">[
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْجِبٌ</span></b>  <i>A place where one falls down and
dies; where one dies</i>]. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَرَجَ القَوْمُ إِلَى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوَاجِبِهِمْ</span>, i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الى مَصَارِعِهِمْ</span>; <i>The people went
forth to the places where they should be prostrated;</i> or, <i>as implied in the</i> S, <i>where they should
full down and die;</i> or <i>where they should die</i>].
(S.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُوجِبٌ</span> [and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُوجِبَةٌ</span></b> ] <i>A cause; an
efficient; that which produces,</i> or <i>effects, anything.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَلَامٌ مُوجَبٌ</span> ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُوجِبٌ</span>
